  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Do you love doing your nails at home? Are you a nail tech? Are you looking to expand your income by promoting products on your social media and online?<br>Look no further!</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">LUMII is a new brand, based in the UK, targeting the UK and US markets.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We sell a premium polygel 'hard gel' nail product called UltraGel. It's easy and quick to apply and allows you to do your own nail extensions at home, for a fraction of the cost of getting them done in a salon!</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">UltraGel is tougher than BIAB or standard UV cured gels meaning that you can use UltraGel for extensions, without a nail tip!<br>It's also much lighter and SO much easier to work with than Acrylic nails.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">LUMII UltraGel comes in two kits - the Starter Kit and Ultimate Kit. Both kits come with a single colour of UltraGel Polygel but more colours can be purchased alongside a kit for a HUGE discount.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">There's also a few other revolutionary at home nail products for sale from LUMII:<br>A Magic Gel Remover that's a super fast brush-on product to remove ALL UV cured gel products as well as UltraGel. PLUS bundles of our high quality toxic-chemical-free UV gels and top coat and base coat bundles.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We're offering a generous discount of 15% of the price of all sales you make as an affiliate with quick payment terms too.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">If you have any more questions about our products, including getting FREE SAMPLES to get you started - don't hesitate to get in touch! ❤️✨</p>",
